        OrderCtrl[CheckoutController]
        GodOrderSvc[GodCheckoutService<br/>- User Ban Validation<br/>- Cart & Catalog Pricing<br/>- Inventory SQL Updates<br/>- Stripe / PayPal Switch<br/>- SMTP Email Dispatch]
    end

    MegaCheckout -->|POST /checkout| OrderCtrl
    OrderCtrl --> GodOrderSvc
